<title>USA: American Radio completes buy of EZ.</title>
<headline>American Radio completes buy of EZ.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va. 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Radio Systems Corp completed its acquisition of EZ Communications Inc, with EZ holders to get $11.75 cash and 0.9 share of American Radio for each EZ share, EZ said Monday.</p>
<p>EZ shares closed at 39 on April 4, the day the merger became final.</p>
<p>American Radio was up 3/8 to 31-1/8 at midday.</p>
